,"name":"Frady's One Stop Food Store","address":"3231 Dauphine St","city":"New Orleans","state":"LA","postal_code":"70117","stars":4.5,"review_count":73,"categories":["Delis","Food","Grocery","Restaurants"],"is_open":true},"evidence":{"source":"frozen-model","summary":{"business_id":"Hp3Ony7yW60VPuWHQFIIHA","user_id":"D76EFdD5F7XoIIyQmWTQhA","user_row":3279,"nv_rank":1095,"mm_rank":772,"target_category_support_fraction":0.5,"selected_image_count":2,"label_diversity":2,"target_visual_score_gain":null,"target_visual_rank_gain":null,"competitive_visual_rank_effect":null},"category_overlap":[{"category":"Delis","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Food","historical_business_count":3},{"category":"Grocery","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Restaurants","historical_business_count":8}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Hp3Ony7yW60VPuWHQFIIHA","review_id":"actSTabygm27qPKyUKVCxw","date":"2013-09-18T05:16:10","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9260910153388977,"text_excerpt":"Excellent po boys They were out of oysters that day so I settled for a shrimp po bay and it was soooo good. This is the kinda place that locals come to and not many tourist that don't have a car. They also have fried chicken in the hot box along with other items like liver and smothered onions. What I liked here is that the lady that serves is nice ( this seems to be a theme in New Orleans , I live in NYC where EVERYONE has a ' tude ) True meaning of southern hospitality. They have little chairs outside where you can just chill and have your po' boy with a beer and talk to local wino outsisde True authentic New Orleans experience !"},{"business_id":"Hp3Ony7yW60VPuWHQFIIHA","review_id":"OVGFRcCoRIGbCHI8OO44vA","date":"2015-03-24T14:04:57","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.921910285949707,"text_excerpt":"This place holds great sentimental value for me. I basically grew up at the counter here. The Frady's are pretty much family and they treat everyone with the same kindness. I have even helped behind the counter when the neighborhood was packed for a parade or festival! Frady's stuffed miriltons are some of the best. So is the Roast Beef Po-Boy and just about any other po-boy you can get there. Also, THE BREAD PUDDING IS TO DIE FOR. I don't know what Kirk puts in that stuff, but gosh I could eat that all day!"},{"business_id":"Hp3Ony7yW60VPuWHQFIIHA","review_id":"1TWrm6Iui0j5IhG6o0rwUA","date":"2015-12-04T03:39:54","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9156539440155029,"text_excerpt":"This place is a classic corner store, and a definite diamond in the hipster rough. They have rotating home cooked foods, where $8 gets you a meat and three sides (all of which usually have meat). They also make pretty decent poboys. The best part about this place is the service - not only are they fast, but they are some of the friendliest people you will meet. It's a refreshing alternative to many of the newer, recent offerings which focus more on trendy atmosphere rather than good food and service."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Hp3Ony7yW60VPuWHQFIIHA","photo_id":"PhTqQB03rlTVi6eqmCsHzg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/PhTqQB03rlTVi6eqmCsHzg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8717278838157654},{"business_id":"Hp3Ony7yW60VPuWHQFIIHA","photo_id":"QDkIYaOM_qn4viVk706ETw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/QDkIYaOM_qn4viVk706ETw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8717277646064758}]},"notebook_case":null}
